Phase 5 – Project Development

1. Project Title
FitBuddy – AI Fitness Plan Generator using Gemini Models

2. Development Objective
The objective of this phase is to develop the FitBuddy application and integrate Google Gemini AI to generate personalized fitness plans.

3. Development Components

3.1 User Interface
The application will provide a form for entering:
Name
Age
Height
Weight
Fitness goal
Activity level
Fitness experience
Available workout time

3.2 AI Integration
Google Gemini will be integrated into the application to process the user's fitness information and generate a personalized fitness plan.

3.3 Prompt Generation
The application will create a prompt using the information entered by the user and send it to the Gemini model.

3.4 Fitness Plan Generation
Gemini will generate:
Workout recommendations
Weekly workout schedule
Exercise suggestions
General nutrition suggestions
Fitness tips

3.5 Output Display
The generated fitness plan will be displayed on the application in a clear and readable format.

4. Development Workflow
User Input → Form Processing → Gemini AI → Generated Fitness Plan → Display Output

5. Development Tools
HTML
CSS
JavaScript
Google Gemini API
Visual Studio Code
GitHub
Web Browser

6. Implementation
The application will be developed step by step:
Create the user interface.
Create the fitness information form.
Add JavaScript functionality.
Connect the application with Gemini.
Create the AI prompt.
Generate the fitness plan.
Display the result.
Test the application.
Fix errors and improve the interface.

7. Expected Result
The developed FitBuddy application will accept user fitness information and use Google Gemini to generate a personalized fitness plan.
